<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong gold market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong gold market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's gold market was closed on Thursday for the beginning of the Chinese lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on February 10.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
